          </div>
          <div class='content'><div class="user-text"><pre>Hello Claude! Can you help me understand how Python decorators work?</pre></div></div>
          
          <div class='fold-bar' data-message-id='d-3' data-border-color='user'>
              
              
              <div class='fold-bar-section fold-one-level full-width' data-action='fold-one' data-target='d-3' data-title-unfolded='Fold 1 assistant' data-title-folded='Unfold (1st level) 1 assistant' title='Fold 1 assistant'>
